{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02760","headline":"咏史四首 一 · 卢照邻","name":"咏史四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季生昔未达，身辱功不成。\n髠钳爲台隶，灌园变姓名。\n幸逢滕将军，兼遇曹丘生。\n汉祖广招纳，一朝拜公卿。\n百金孰云重，一诺良匪轻。\n廷议斩樊哙，羣公寂无声。\n处身孤且直，遭时坦而平。\n丈夫当如此，唯唯何足荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}